Depends: vdr-plugin-text2skin (>= 2.0.0~), fonts-vdrsymbols-ttf, ${misc:Depends}
Description: anthra skin anthra_OSt for the VDR text2skin plugin
 The dark anthra skin by Tomas Saxer (variant 1920 FSt) for the text2skin
 plugin of VDR, ported to text2skin 2.0.
 .
 The skin scales itself to the size of the OSD. Its options (channel and
 separator logos, menu logos and font, timer info, EPG and recording images
 from scraper plugins, signal display, scroll indicator) are set in the setup
 menu of text2skin.
